        "id": 17442,
        "title": "Longitudes",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 147932,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos a descubrir cómo podemos contar los elementos en arrays y usar esta información de manera inteligente en un juego.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 147933,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Usamos la palabra <code>length</code> después del nombre del array y un punto <code>.</code> para obtener el número de elementos en un array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 147934,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inténtalo tú mismo: comienza con el nombre del array y añade un punto <code>.</code> y luego <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"56\" endIndex=\"63\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"70\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemies</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y finalmente <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 147935,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Agrega <code>console.log()</code> alrededor de <code>enemies.length</code> para mostrar la longitud del array <code>enemies</code> en la consola.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"70\" endIndex=\"71\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>console.log</code> seguido de <code>(</code> y finalmente <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 147936,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>También podemos almacenar la longitud de un array en una variable.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 147937,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crea una variable <code>length</code> y almacena la longitud del array en ella.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"items\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"50\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"58\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"73\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" length = enemies.length;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>length</code> seguido de <code>=</code> y finalmente <code>enemies.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 147938,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>No importa cuántos elementos haya en un array, <code>length</code> los contará por nosotros.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 147939,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inténtalo tú mismo: cuenta los elementos en el array <code>enemies</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"howMany\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"75\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"83\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"89\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;skeleton&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;orc&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemies</code> seguido de <code>.</code> y finalmente <code>length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 147940,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Incluso si el array <code>enemies</code> está vacío, <code>enemies.length</code> nos da el número de elementos en él.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 147941,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Almacena un array vacío en <code>enemies</code> para ver que su longitud es <code>0</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(enemies.length);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"{\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"}\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>[</code> seguido de <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 147942,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar la longitud de un array para crear <strong>declaraciones condicionales</strong> que dependen de su número de elementos.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 147943,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inténtalo: solo muestra el mensaje si <code>enemies.length</code> es mayor que <code>0</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"62\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemies = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;slime&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;bat&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;goblin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (enemies.length &gt; \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Enemies incoming!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>enemies.length</code> seguido de <code>&gt;</code> y finalmente <code>0</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 147944,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>También podemos usar la longitud de un array para crear <strong>bucles for</strong> que recorran todos sus elementos.</p><p>Para eso, repetimos un bucle tantas veces como haya elementos en el array usando la propiedad <code>length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #14",
            "id": 147945,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Repite el bucle for dos veces especificando que <code>i</code> debe ser menor que la <code>length</code> del array.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i &gt;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"56\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i &lt;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #15",
            "id": 147946,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ejecuta el bucle for tres veces especificando que <code>i</code> debe ser menor que <code>inventory.length</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"83\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>i</code> seguido de <code>&lt;</code> y finalmente <code>inventory.length</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #16",
            "id": 147947,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>La variable contador, <code>i</code>, almacena los valores <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, y <code>2</code> a medida que el bucle se repite. Pero <code>0</code>, <code>1</code>, y <code>2</code> son también los <strong>índices</strong> de los elementos en <code>inventory</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #17",
            "id": 147948,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Así que cada vez que el bucle se repite, <code>i</code> almacena un <strong>índice</strong> de un elemento en el array <code>inventory</code>. Y podemos usar el índice para acceder al elemento.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;shield&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #18",
            "id": 147949,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dale una vuelta al bucle: usa la variable contador, <code>i</code>, como el índice para mostrar todos los elementos en <code>inventory</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"x\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"112\" endIndex=\"121\" /><option startIndex=\"121\" endIndex=\"122\" /><option startIndex=\"122\" endIndex=\"123\" /><option startIndex=\"123\" endIndex=\"124\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" inventory = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;sword&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;potion&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;coin&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;key&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; inventory.length; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(inventory[i]);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Asegúrese de elegir <code>inventory</code> seguido de <code>[</code> y luego <code>i</code>, <code>]</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
